3		 * Spending Report page
4		 *
5		 * Rolls a year's Expenses up through Category → Grouping → Area of Importance
6		 * and renders the month-by-month grid (subtotals per Grouping and Importance,
7		 * a Year-to-Date column, Uncategorized at the bottom, Grand Total).
8		 *
9		 * All aggregation is the pure `buildSpendingReport` — this page only loads the
10		 * data and paints the grid. Design: docs/plans/2026-07-09-spending-report-design.md
11		 */
12	
13		import { onMount } from 'svelte';
